	(text "From +24V through a 0.5 A quick fuse (RECOM requires one). Isolation of the module not used: COM = AGND.\nTPS3710 holds RDY low below 12.3-12.8 V on +15 V: a dead sensor supply never reads as 0 A while enabled.\n-15 V is not monitored separately (one converter): firmware checks AN1 plausibility."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 272.112 78.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "00c5d917-788a-5c7c-8489-e825050b6b2b")
	)
	(text "2.5 V - 1k - T_L - winding NTC (inside L_CELL, header on sheet 04) - AGND: the NTC lead next to the 124 V/ns\nwinding ends on AGND and the 100 nF T_L node, never on the reference. Buffered (OPA4322 D) to AN3_P via 47R;\nmonitoring only (no local trip in the spec). Open NTC reads 2.5 V like -40 C: firmware plausibility check\n(winding colder than the heatsink at load = fault). Fan law and hot-spot limit in firmware."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 265.329 227.868 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0582ef96-e1c4-53ec-b87f-2c291db0bb55")
	)
	(text "Lead A of L_CELL (insulated, screen earthed in the aperture) passes through the transducer; positive = SW_A ->\ninductor -> SW_B. IS = IP/2000 into RM 20R to AGND: 10 mV/A. Linear +/-114 A, delay <= 0.52 us; CTRL backup\npeak 106.0 A (< 129 A). LAYOUT: lead <= 100 C at the transducer (LA 150-P p4), RM and the +/-15 V return at\none AGND point next to the transducer; no other conductor through the aperture."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 61.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0e9fcbe5-30a9-55a6-982e-413016a8fc3d")
	)
	(text "2.5 V - 10k - T_HS - NTC (B57703M, screwed next to the hottest device) - AGND: 2.43 V at -40 C ... 0.045 V at\n150 C, buffered (OPA4322 C) to AN2_P via 47R. TLV3502 A: low above 95.0 C (92.3-97.9 C); B: low when T_HS\n> TH_OPEN (open probe reads 2.5 V; -40 C reads 2.432 V) -> OT_WIN_OK = OT_OK AND NTC_OK -> latch (PVR-08)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 253.868 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0fd4d8de-5812-50be-ba7c-f6472207d2cb")
	)
	(text "+/-15 V FOR THE LA 150-P (RS3-2415D)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 272.112 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "26840d33-fadf-54fe-a5df-26a051305dcf")
	)
	(text "LM4040 A grade from 3V3 through 120R: 2.6 mA worst load + 65 uA, <= 8.4 mA total (15 mA\nmax). Feeds the OC thresholds, the OT threshold and both NTC dividers (OT is ratiometric)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.572 133.924 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3849efec-e589-515c-902f-9f27a102e208")
	)
	(text "TLV3502 on AN1_P through 220R/1n: OCP_OK low above TH_HI, OCN_OK low below TH_LO -> latch. Trip 68.5-76.0 A\n(all tolerances); gate off 0.94 us after the crossing (PWM path), 1.73 us via EN; allowed 3.66 us.\nOPA4322 B: VMID buffer for the AN1 driver."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 171.648 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "492ece0e-f51f-5f85-a14a-db43b482e36f")
	)
	(text "OPA4322 A: AN1_P = VMID + V_M (gain 2 on (V_M + VMID)/2); OPA2322 A: AN1_N = VMID - V_M (inverting, + at\nVMID/2). Direct drive (< 1 ohm closed loop) of the ribbon and the CTRL 1.50 k open-input bias (<= 2.3 mA).\nCTRL AFE 0.402 -> 0.0759 A/LSB. An unplugged cable reads far negative on CTRL (its bias)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 129.16 83.084 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "49b23aaf-c994-564b-88af-f35e17cd7c72")
	)
